title: "how-sure: small tools and notes from a petroleum geologist's work"
abstract: "Small tools and notes from my work as a petroleum geologist. Each one deals with the same question: how sure are we, and what would make us surer? Tool 01 is a post-drill look-back template in Excel (prediction vs. result) with a hand-worked example and 32 checks."
